"""Full Arabic-in-kitty test suite (v2).

Usage:
    python ar-test-full            run everything
    python ar-test-full 2 3        run only groups 2 and 3
    python ar-test-full --check    only the automatic round-trip check
    python ar-test-full exp        side-by-side experiments for the unsure cases

Reading the output: each case prints an id, an `expect:` line saying what a correct
render looks like, then the rendered line. Arabic reads right to left, so the FIRST
word must be at the RIGHT edge, letters joined and in order, numbers reading normally.
Send back the ids of the wrong lines.
"""
